  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.03 “Board” means “board” as defined in RSA 153:27, I, namely, “the mechanical licensing board established in RSA 153:27-a.”\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15; ss by #13483, eff 1-9-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 102.02) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
